<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $67-1/8 (FIM 322.04).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $67-1/8 (FIM 322.04).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed up $1 at $67-1/8 in New York on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 322.04 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Wednesday, Nokia A closed up 1.50 at 315.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed up $1 at $34 on Wall Street. The price equals about 81.56 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 4.40 markka at 82.90.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR ended down $0-1/4 at $19-1/2 in New York on Wednesday. The price corresponds to about 93.55 markka. In Helsinki, Rauma closed flat up 0.50 markka 95.50 markka. --Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
